                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Ceilidh-jo Rowe",
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "Beautiful acoustic music loved by children and their adults. Many Moons is a collection of classic lullabies and soothing songs, for all those who have never lost their sense of wonder. Go on a pirate adventure, embrace the mountains and the bluebells, sparkle with the spider and glide along with the little boat.  Ceilidh-jo’s children's music has long been a staple for many families in the car, at home playing, relaxing and at bedtime.  Here’s a lovely review - “I have found no other children's music that even comes close to this wonderful collection. The music has it’s roots in history but speaks to our 21st century kids. It charms my 2 young kids into blissful contentment as they are transported to a magical land. I would recommend this album for all families.",
